# GNU Stow ignore list for this package.
#
# Stow uses THIS file *instead of* its built-in default ignore list, so the
# defaults are copied below — otherwise `.git/`, README.md, etc. would start
# being symlinked into $HOME. Patterns with a `/` match the full path relative
# to the target dir; patterns without a `/` match a path segment (basename).
# This file itself is always ignored by Stow.

# --- Stow's built-in default list (copied verbatim) ---
RCS
.+,v

CVS
\.\#.+       # CVS conflict files / emacs lock files
\.cvsignore

\.svn
_darcs
\.hg

\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules

.+~          # emacs backup files
\#.*\#       # emacs autosave files

^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING

# --- repo-local additions ---
# Repo-root AGENTS.md is tracked by git but must not be linked into $HOME.
# Root-anchored so .config/opencode/AGENTS.md is still deployed.
^/AGENTS\.md$

# Install artifacts (opencode's plugin/MCP deps). Regenerated by npm on demand
# and already present in $HOME as real files owned by opencode, so stowing them
# would collide with every file inside them.
node_modules
